  "sourceSummary": "BNSSG NHS My Joint Health Hub Toe Yoga: seated at chair edge with feet flat, lift big toe while lesser toes2-5 remain on floor, slowly lower. This exact big-toe-extension demonstration isolates that active extension half; it does not perform the subsequent reverse lesser-toe lift. No hand assistance, band or passive stretch.30degree range and8second cycle are illustrative, not a prescribed dose.",
